Package: sedacore
Title: Discover, Retrieve, and Harmonize Contextual Data for Marine
    Sediment Cores
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Chiara", "Vanni", , "cvanni@marum.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to visualize marine sediment core locations, retrieve
    and parse matching PANGAEA (and IODP) datasets, discover neighbouring
    cores within a radius, and harmonize units and interpolate depths into
    a unified long-format table for use in sedaDNA and other metaanalyses.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
